     8181                       old_price-doc-forming-gds.pdf-db     = old_price-doc-forming.pdf-db    and
     8182                       old_price-doc-forming-gds.b-code     = buf_price-doc-forming-gds.b-code :
     8183                for each old_price-all no-lock where
