     8215   procedure ver-pr-equ-qS :
     8216   define input parameter  p-plt-id      as integer   no-undo .
     8217   define input parameter  p-plt-db-num  as integer   no-undo .
     8218   define input parameter  p-pdf-id      as integer   no-undo .
