    10067          buf_price-doc-forming-gds.excise-doc:HIDDEN IN FRAME Dialog-Frame           = TRUE.
    10068   ASSIGN
    10069          buf_price-doc-forming-gds.road-tax-doc:HIDDEN IN FRAME Dialog-Frame           = TRUE.
